      <title>中广核招远核电2号机组主体开工 六台华龙一号加速沿海布局</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B9%BF%E6%A0%B8%E6%8B%9B%E8%BF%9C%E6%A0%B8%E7%94%B52%E5%8F%B7%E6%9C%BA%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%BC%80%E5%B7%A5-%E5%85%AD%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%8E%E9%BE%99%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%B7%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E6%B2%BF%E6%B5%B7%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80/</link>
